  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "二零零六年十二月十六日，早上八点，东京西新宿。",
      "sha256": "5e611eec819fa8b2571a83772f12eccd1cc3e2847d25fe652f56febb7bbea03c",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.79,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.21
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "有人报警：路边躺着一个假人。",
      "sha256": "5405b4b4317e6976ba07848adf07d438aca098cd568af3c56b9a9e0a78b92a0e",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 6.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.02,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "警察一到，警戒带围了起来。那不是假人。",
      "sha256": "ff8f9397361df8a165e43e0e5db2d48429fa6c8a95b42ef165d2ef1a70e1f8ad",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 10.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.92,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "十二天后，涩谷一处空宅的院子里，挖出了下半身。",
      "sha256": "deb264290bc36b2c65181627de94f1c145efff5bde6144ed7eb37abd833c2830",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 16.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.03,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.97
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "两处遗体一比对，是同一个男人。",
      "sha256": "c6a588ef174362ed8a6cf79272f41458ae4fc1241dcd23d791c31b5aafd92280",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 22.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.32,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.68
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "他三十岁，在外资投行做分析师。",
      "sha256": "bb498d1780f3d8656d42647eb67a2bc74f27258194d11e39d9cf749f74c3969c",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 28.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.62,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.38
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "去警署报失踪的，是他妻子。",
      "sha256": "7d3dd245a63aabb9479609dccc046ee561ef140622fe1c761c71db1c106e26b0",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 34.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.11,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.89
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "她写：身高一米六六，胸口有一道手术疤。",
      "sha256": "95800e3ebf4605d9247e62081922aeaa22a08aa12d94f8de9b1f905d32cf2102",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 40.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.03,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.97
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "可找到的遗体上，没有那道疤。",
      "sha256": "c2b4212e79f234e2b370774233e3b208926ffbe0cc230197998580c6305afee1",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 46.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.89,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 3.11
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "监控里，他最后一次回家，是十二月十二日清晨。",
      "sha256": "ed9702fcc730a917ca62854ea793a9d7b2458b500afa443e9484e9728952cdd0",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 52.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.6,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "从那天起，这栋楼再没拍到他出来。",
      "sha256": "82b0f2a66c996a12b4faaf9c8735b205a357f4585622067c7fb99d65c062ace6",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 58.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.92,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "两天后，夜里十点，她拖着一只大行李箱下楼。",
      "sha256": "22c618c143019e1d25e39e36886bde28c548d30f1b4cd5c9c6476175e637411f",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 64.0,
      "target_duration": 9,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.73,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 4.27
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "四个小时后，她空着手回来。",
      "sha256": "58b6365d7f636bd072f4275c9ae0f37c0ccc8c498611484f62b2f1aab18818ad",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 73.0,
      "target_duration": 3,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.73,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.27
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "十五分钟后，她又推了一辆手推车出门。",
      "sha256": "765acf74a0f4ca69e90c53abeafb41d33f62a506b81c36279138c34ad65207f9",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 76.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.54,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.46
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "二十分钟后，车没回来，她两手空空。",
      "sha256": "b241f5afe2f73c67817ef5517a8a2888f95a5f9ef8b8aff5118f3bb00ee82b95",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 82.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.73,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.27
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "警方把这四个小时，一秒一秒看完。",
      "sha256": "953bc6c1f572b3003bd4c34868dd4a18f3bd92bb27cd0cbf9e7e2abf745221f9",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 88.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.41,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.59
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "她家刚装修过。地板是新的。",
      "sha256": "ce999049c522e54090b8c1c61acc3d346de46e0f185b2e2988f02e05fb180dbc",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 94.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.32,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.68
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "倒放的衣柜里，铺了二十袋种植土。",
      "sha256": "1d0397e7f5defcc95f5ca044597ec6d333a058b8e1653fbd5ac90daedcbef06a",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 100.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.01,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.99
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "土，和他身上的一样。",
      "sha256": "5bf272d311124c95c30fbf27d76d6760cfb7f49fd749e21ccc41ed28aff0e61b",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 106.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.51,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 3.49
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "被捕后，她把那几天全交代了。",
      "sha256": "53f7c49c076e4e91cfa14b7f7711cba6aeddd712cfa32c742a35209ce74460db",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 112.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.11,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.89
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "她说，那天早上他喝醉了回家。",
      "sha256": "3456e472dd5384d47f5d59704e3e28f1bdc26ab494d6c4589f68a45a54df5aa4",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 118.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.62,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.38
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "她拿出离婚申请书。他当场撕了。",
      "sha256": "5d6729bf1fcdba098c46f989b35d651e76c499d603c01f534e958c2531a32f08",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 124.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.2,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "三年婚姻，她进过庇护所，诊断是创伤后应激障碍。",
      "sha256": "3f5c08df89c2c6f23fa0deb8d9a06c17d4298b5fae0260d070be9864c686a648",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 130.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.3,
      "atempo": 1.05,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "二零零五年，鼻骨被打断。那一次她报过警。",
      "sha256": "220ed444f874142ef043ecfb1528725dd2d94c060628862d542ce52c8a560e47",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 136.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.52,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.48
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "辩护席的主张是：她当时心智丧失，应当无罪。",
      "sha256": "99aacc28995c628b116599f6893f4c3e4f51be58f8930df694e5420324f428ee",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 142.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.2,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "二零零八年四月二十八日，东京地裁宣判。",
      "sha256": "be9a62481e17a4c4a1bbb05492d8f3bd5adc8d3beec4ee857c0fa9f3b485ca04",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 148.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.44,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.56
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "幻听是真的。失眠和长期压力，把她压垮了。",
      "sha256": "7775bbda4f65cf4b6cf8c178e903ddf2df676aa6500343a8851503e29f8613fd",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 154.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.03,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.97
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "但法院说：动手和善后，每一步她都清楚。",
      "sha256": "d1af2f92dd719e61764511b422d0c97757db4e3afe8121ec84850736b005fa33",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 160.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.39,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.61
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "求刑二十年，判十五年。上诉驳回，她放弃上告。",
      "sha256": "adafc55401e6de8ae13bfb409a9873f86aacc8b742996fbc15dd3c029bccd6d5",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 166.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.41,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.59
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "那次报警之后，如果有人一直跟到底，会怎样？",
      "sha256": "6f1b33d0a07f8c3c499fed2769051ddc140ac88985356e29c2689c17e9892f06",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 172.0,
      "target_duration": 8,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.71,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.29
    }
  ]
}
